<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S4.SS6" title="In 4 Experimental Methodology ‣ Downsized and Compromised?: Assessing the Faithfulness of Model Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">4.6 </span>Metric Assessment and Discussion Strategy</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_section"><a href="#S5" title="In Downsized and Compromised?: Assessing the Faithfulness of Model Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">5 </span>Model Size and Accuracy</span></a>
