<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS2" title="In 6 Model Agreement ‣ Downsized and Compromised?: Assessing the Faithfulness of Model Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.2 </span>Testing for Statistical Significance</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS3" title="In 6 Model Agreement ‣ Downsized and Compromised?: Assessing the Faithfulness of Model Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.3 </span>Predicting Model Agreement</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#S6.SS4" title="In 6 Model Agreement ‣ Downsized and Compromised?: Assessing the Faithfulness of Model Compression" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">6.4 </span>Analysis and Discussion</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
